15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Transfer to the wire rack to drain excess oil for 1–2 minutes while still piping hot, then finish with 6.7 tbsp double cream, 6.7 tbsp milk, 3 tbsp golden syrup, 0.5 tsp vanilla extract, 6.7 tbsp caster sugar, and 2 tsp cinnamon. Serve Churros fresh while the exterior is shatteringly crisp."}]
